<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. &#x2610;</p>
<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is a shell company (as defined in Rule&#xa0;12b-2 of the Exchange Act). Yes <ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityShellCompany" format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" contextRef="d_2023-04-01_2023-06-30">&#x2610;</ix:nonNumeric> No &#x2612;</p>
<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt;">As of August 10, 2023, <ix:nonFraction name="dei:EntityCommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="Share" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" contextRef="i_2023-08-10">9,362,444</ix:nonFraction> shares of the registrant&#x2019;s common stock, $0.001 par value, were issued and outstanding.&#xa0;</p>
