   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The amounts reported as receivable from collaboration partner at <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2023 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2023 </em>represent payments we made to a CRO and another service provider for project and clinical trial services on behalf of our collaboration partner. Our collaboration partner reimbursed us for $<ix:nonFraction id="c101608440" contextRef="d_2023-05-01_2023-05-31" unitRef="USD" name="vtgn:ReimbursementFromCollaborationPartner" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">174,700</ix:nonFraction> in <em style="font: inherit;"> May 2023. </em>The receivable for insurance claim represents insurance reimbursement related to matters associated with a terminated former employee. We received the reimbursement from our insurance carrier in <em style="font: inherit;"> July 2023.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
