   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Property and equipment, net is composed of the following:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
