     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">volatility resulting from uncertainty and general economic conditions;</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
     <td style="width: 18pt;">&#xa0;</td>
     <td style="width: 18pt;">&#xa0;</td>
     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#xa0;</p> </td>
    </tr>

