     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">plans for, progress of or results from nonclinical and clinical development activities related to our product candidates;</p> </td>
    </tr>

