     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">establishment of short positions by holders or non-holders of our stock or warrants;</p> </td>
    </tr>

    <tr style="vertical-align: top;">
     <td style="width: 18pt;">&#xa0;</td>
